// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1682907024" "Whatever they want with him, William Marshall is in trouble. You heard a rumor about something like this. Maybe you could help."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1734390291" "{PERSON_NAME} is a renowned psychic who's precognitive predictions have helped the city in past. No doubt the lure of knowing the future made the {VillainGroup} bolder than normal."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P652174791" "The moment you hear the news, you suspect what might have happened. {PERSON_NAME} has consulted with MAGI on a case or two involving magical diseases, something that the {VillainGroup} would definitely be interested in."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1797672562" "Dr. Long's work on incorporating magical healing with modern medicine has made a big splash. Big enough to attract the attention of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1385505275" "That was a bold attack for the {VillainGroup} to make. Whatever the witness saw, it must have been important."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2006764397" "This sounds bad. That helpless citizen could be in a lot of trouble the moment the {VillainGroup} decide they don't need their hostage anymore."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3203740487" "An undercover officer who misses a check-in may just be in the middle of something, but you'd heard a rumor that the {VillainGroup} were looking for an undercover cop. This might be one to check into."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P254091407" "That missing lawyer is probably {PERSON_NAME}, the attorney who went missing a bit back. This could be a lead in that case."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1316390495" "You've heard of Clive before. The only thing more disturbing than the curios in the back of the shop are the stories he tells about them. You'd better get him back to his shop. That would be safest for everyone involved."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3761043998" "What would the {VillainGroup} want with a writer? Well, whatever their plan is, it's putting a citizen in danger."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3118216592" "You've heard of the strange case of Dr. Stephen Fayte before. Due to random circumstances of birth, he's often mistaken for one of the most powerful sorcerers in the world. However, he's really just a gifted surgeon, and nothing more. If the {VillainGroup} is involved, though, he could be in some serious trouble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3092439729" "As you listen further, it seems that the hostage was one of their Artificial Intelligence researchers, a {PERSON_NAME}. But no one has any idea why the {VillainGroup} would be interested in an AI researcher in the first place."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1508078601" "If the {VillainGroup} are involved, this can't be good. Maybe you should give the police some help on this one."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P864954347" "You remember that {PERSON_NAME} used to be a big rock star back in the day, until there was a scandal about using magic to control minds. Nothing was proven, but that might be enough to have brought her to the attention of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P114941025" "The {VillainGroup} issued a threat against Preston Ramone after he promised he wouldn't let their threats hamper his plans for re-development in Overbrook. The Police are already on this, but it might be a good idea to show some support form Paragon City's heroes, too."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P417891839" "{PERSON_NAME}? That's the cellist with minor psychic powers. While she's not effective in a fight, the combination of music an psionics could be very interesting to the {VillainGroup}. This might be worth checking out."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2061256657" "You remember hearing about that. {PERSON_NAME}, the famous novelist, was thought to have been killed in a car accident. But if he's still alive, could he have been in {VillainGroup} captivity all this time? Maybe you should check into this."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4283268888" "{PERSON_NAME}? That sounds familiar. Now you remember! You read about it in the papers, but there they just called her 'Nancy'. She was in the news because her remarkable resistance to curses allowed her to safely inherit the cursed gemstone 'the Third Eye of Danger'. The papers had called it magical evolution, but it looks like it might have brought her to the attention of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2545955280" "That sounds like trouble. Maybe the {VillainGroup} are chasing {PERSON_NAME}, or maybe it's a coincidence. Either way, it could bear investigation."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1514481046" "If the {VillainGroup} were involved it, it can't be good. Maybe you should take a look at this."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1286060801" "More and more refugees from the strange alien realm called the Shadow Shard have been coming to Paragon City, looking for new lives. Unfortunately, the City's villains have noticed this as well. It might be a good idea to show a new arrival why Paragon is called the City of Heroes."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1192289099" "More and more refugees from the strange alien realm called the Shadow Shard have been coming to Paragon City, looking for new lives. Unfortunately, the City's villains have noticed this as well. It might be a good idea to show a new arrival that the heroes of Paragon City are there to protect them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1066716520" "It wouldn't be too unusual for a reporter to drop off the map for a bit, but when that reporter's investigating the {VillainGroup}, that might be something to worry about. This might bear an investigation."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2273394181" "That sounds remarkably apathetic, but then, {PERSON_NAME} is Unbelievable-Man's girlfriend. But didn't you hear that he's in the Shadow Shard right now? Maybe you should check into this, just in case Unbelievable-Man won't be back in time to save the day."

