"P1831738130" "Few can truly understand the preternatural horrors that exist beyond time and space. <em>Alien realms of unnatural geometries ruled by unknown beings. <em>Let me tell you the tale of Arthur Jeremyn and the strange puzzle-box he discovered in an unused hotel one winter..."
