"P1342052770" "You do not control this city!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1054792266" "I cannot play my music for soulless fiends like you."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2893937733" "I can't write any more for you. I have writer's block!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3545041799" "But I don't think those will work on me."
