// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1619745246" "What do you want with me?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P4009200125" "I tried to tell them this wouldn't end well."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3345026576" "This will nearly drive me insane!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2511902330" "You people stay back!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3542411095" "What a day!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1658444720" "See? What did I tell you? Amateurs!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2619990638" "I gotta be more careful!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P18910666" "You do realize this is just adding to the civil suit?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3351845446" "Oh, my. And I was just about to start telling them a story."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P4174481250" "This is so going in my next novel."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P34142912" "This is annoying."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P215677184" "What will happen next!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3577082228" "Man, I gotta stop drinkin!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2130448663" "How about I play you guys a song?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3091131274" "This was only a setback!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2910147566" "I just want to go home."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3432824397" "This is unbelievable!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P191492891" "Help!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2446399623" "This is not an easy city to live in."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2798296360" "This is nothing to me."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P135151728" "Man, what a pain!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3249325712" "This is getting monotonous."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - SAYONARRIVAL_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1134986486" "Let me outta here!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P918412666" "I can see that I'll be safe from here."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1979949073" "Well, that was close."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1284867754" "Thank you, {HeroName}. I can't wait to get back to my work."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1901582744" "I woulda been to scared to testify at all if there weren't heroes like you around."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P753033542" "I've also seen a lot of heroes. I think you got a bright future."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1536708639" "I learned a lot from these guys, but I wouldn't have been able to tell anyone if it weren't for you."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3720220528" "This supernatural law practice is more exciting than I thought it would be."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2052801200" "Well, this has been quite a day, hasn't it?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3724553336" "I'm going to put this whole chapter behind me."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P448265966" "Thank you, {HeroName}. You really saved me, as I am only a gifted surgeon, and nothing more."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2156022442" "What an experience! Thank you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3818337981" "So, I'm like immortal now or something? *hic*"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3828228111" "I came through this okay. Maybe I could do a come-back?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3140127628" "Nothing will keep me from rebuilding this city!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2170948889" "You saved my life, and my music. Thank you."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2543507043" "Y'know, all this gives me a great idea for a novel..."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P200023437" "I think I know how to get there from here."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2833218936" "I only want to be a doctor. Is that wrong?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P309648575" "Really, I probably shouldn't be toting this around, but it is kind of a keepsake."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P971810615" "It is because of heroes like you that I feel safe here."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P836356643" "I see now that the stories of Paragon's heroes are all true."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2042514128" "Thanks for the help, pal."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3858835875" "Thanks for the help and all, but I think I'm going to have some words for Unbelievable-Man later."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2948798430" "Tell me, what do you know of Mu?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1213017619" "And your power will take us higher!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1423084799" "Yes, and then a step to the right."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1208643573" "Abandon hope Dr. Long. No one can save you now."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3279022902" "For us. <em>For you."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P394112921" "You're nagging shortens your useful life a great deal."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1585647968" "You were betrayed by simple arcane numerology. Basic magic, really."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1304800695" "There must be a way to circumvent it."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2038380386" "If I just don't listen, the words can't hurt me. <em>That's it. <em>Just don't listen. JUST DON'T LISTEN!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3434934091" "You're descriptions of certain supernatural elements are all too real."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2027672805" "You fool! He's merely a gifted surgeon, and nothing more!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P631853803" "And if they have souls, what can we do with them?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2134256291" "You WHAT!?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3949005323" "Tell us the secrets of your great rock and roll swindle!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P862523067" "Ha!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P712455810" "You'll play when we tell you, or never again."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P37569215" "So just make up more!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3711205332" "Then we'll try harder!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2543841237" "You truly know nothing of your heritage. A pity."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3906328450" "The power of that stone is unimaginable."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P213259790" "You will fear us!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4036555114" "Are you mocking our power?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P784556143" "Something doesn't seem right about this one..."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1036811898" "There is no escape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2882173469" "Are you fool enough to think that you can save {PERSON_NAME} from the {VillainGroup}?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4075471980" "And this is why I hate abducting psychics."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P925192974" "{HeroName}! Dr. Scott!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2612017911" "Stop {HeroName}! This will ruin everything!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2266352454" "No one can learn our true plans!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3891019259" "This won't take us long."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3366928902" "Blast! Steffano must have called for back-up!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2152435974" "This will be the end of you."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P980485775" "{HeroName}! Oh, sweet oblivion!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P119021138" "Die!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P941418357" "Yes, as he is merely a surgeon and nothing more, he is no threat to us."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1867684571" "Too Late!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1705821287" "Today just gets worse."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P33528137" "We must learn the secrets behind the music!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2086305584" "Fool!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P729421636" "Nothing can save you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1584821429" "We need {PERSON_NAME}'s fiction to fuel our plans."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4015299848" "You wont' get anywhere from here!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1358131923" "Truly a pity."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1523597251" "It is a power we will control!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P243822798" "We will show you fear!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3114044690" "We will show you power!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1365874993" "I knew something was wrong."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1955414761" "Dang it!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2282617145" "You're off to rescue a hapless citizen. You only hope you're not too late."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P538085942" "{PERSON_NAME} will be safe and sound if you have anything to say about it."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3301890576" "Hold on just a little while longer, {PERSON_NAME}. Help is on the way."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2109211874" "The {VillainGroup} kidnapping helpless citizens? Not on your watch!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1966578268" "Kidnapping. Just when you thought the {VillainGroup} couldn't sink any lower."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1302085186" "If you're right, {PERSON_NAME} should be around here somewhere."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2573602928" "Word on the street is this is where the {VillainGroup} is hiding {PERSON_NAME}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1802603693" "Did the {VillainGroup} really believe they could hide {PERSON_NAME} here?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P239706415" "There's ample evidence that the {VillainGroup} are here, and most likely with a hostage."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2385158763" "The {VillainGroup} must be desperate to hide {PERSON_NAME}, so desperate they got sloppy."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P434003622" "Time to rescue a hapless Citizen from the clutches of evil."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1944346193" "If those {VillainGroup} villains have hurt {PERSON_NAME}, there will be trouble."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3771821530" "Fortunately you were able to pinpoint this place. Now you can only hope you're not too late."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2325860548" "You don't know how much time {PERSON_NAME} has left at the hands of the {VillainGroup}, but you hope it will be enough."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2893629657" "Time to help the innocent and punish the guilty."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P4221316746" "I hear {HeroName} rescued {PERSON_NAME}. How incredible!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1687490144" "YEAH! Go get 'em, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P4142109950" "{HeroName}! We love you!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1665911615" "Of course {HeroName} saved the day! Was there ever any doubt?"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1807141838" "I hear {HeroName} waltzed right out of there with {PERSON_NAME} safely in tow."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P3790783909" "You're the best, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P908185670" "{HeroName}! That's like awesome to the power of totally radical!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P208014146" "No bad guy can stop {HeroName}, and that's the truth!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P31758032" "{HeroName}! You're the greatest!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P2252847652" "{HeroName} patrolling the streets, and the world is a safer place!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P3957996145" "We all owe {HeroName} a debt we can never repay."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P762815897" "Any city protected by brightly clad weirdos like {HeroName} is a city you can feel safe in."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
